{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "f65cf84fd3305a20c52343eaddb3e9f05cf99a11ad5619c3e5216c820b8fd2ed", "ja": "信じるもの", "zh": "信奉之物", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5fb336682f5704d756f13c138c0039c7cf6e606707faafd3f364356c05252c95", "ja": "子役時代の悪評はすべて本当のことだと告白\nする桃子。自分が悪いと分かりつつも受け入\nれてくれることに一縷の望みをかけるが、衝\n撃を受けた百合子の表情に拒絶を感じ取って\n絶望し、その場から逃げ出してしまう。", "zh": "桃子坦白童星时期的恶评全都属实。\n她虽然深知错在自己，却仍对对方能接受自己\n抱有一丝希望，然而在受到冲击的百合子脸上\n感受到了拒绝，绝望之下逃离了现场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1000_049mom", "source_sha256": "a211dc64edc5055e14224a873d89c2d2a84e6785116e67f462fa443b51aafc1a", "ja": "……デタラメじゃないよ。", "zh": "……不是胡说八道啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "b0ab621e5ff39cdf04c09baa4da9856fc7d53b07ea3cd4747c4579084bb2850a", "ja": "桃子は昔……\nすごくわがままな子供だったんだ。", "zh": "桃子以前……\n可是个非常任性的孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "af145aac7bf46578d6a015c91c739e65d8ff4d386b5ad80aedbecf83eb69f39e", "ja": "あれ買ってきてとか、あの役者さんとはお仕事したく\nないとか、散々わがまま言っておいて……。", "zh": "又是让人去买这个，又是说不想和那个演员一起工作，尽管提了那么多任性要求……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "5ce6d1582dcb09fbb4a77c1cdbbb7616f3583a8d51779e437a97bbaa979db56a", "ja": "「遅い」とか、「使えない」とか「はやく辞めたら？」\nとか……ひどいことたくさん言った。", "zh": "“太慢了”、“真没用”、“怎么还不快点辞职？”\n之类的……说了好多过分的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "6eea57e3d0e3711697d61f2b26ede96080caa7a2d64bbbe3278ab8323fd19d59", "ja": "あの人にだけじゃない。", "zh": "也不只是对他。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "6fcd687fcee296decaa3a95b0b20e168ead8a23ef8043726e63ece2a5c09481d", "ja": "も、桃子ちゃん……？", "zh": "桃、桃子……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "423cac78554f6a9aaad6868c257551bec69f22e44f98107e66057892087a6ca3", "ja": "芸能界ではこれがふつうなんだって。", "zh": "听说在演艺圈这很正常。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "819658025c165cc1e0d103e05622cb6dc5563b3a307c7c9de4fff880588433dc", "ja": "桃子がいないと撮影が始まらないんだから、これくらい\n当たり前だって……ずっとずっと勘違いしてた。", "zh": "我一直一直都误以为，没有桃子就无法开始拍摄，所以做到这种程度是理所当然的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "febe9163f5a33bde1075ca451577b945c0176b08a820476133100ffc4aa50a31", "ja": "桃子ちゃん！　いいから！\nもうなにも言わなくていい！", "zh": "桃子！　好了！\n什么都不用说了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "89de19082fd2dc5ff9956e405fbdcdf9d9d1e94ac177942f426979b317b02088", "ja": "でもね！　全然そんなことなかったの！", "zh": "可是！根本不是那么回事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "3acf3cfcfce8a9a19a4c58053a2b0af31c7e77a84219a5581801b07f8511d4bc", "ja": "（……いつかちゃんと\n言わないといけないと思ってた）", "zh": "（……我一直觉得，总有一天必须好好说出来才行）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "5f64312bdd79915b3174c85934f3f5803236c73f9572913538c020d24501cc33", "ja": "じ……自業自得だよね。そんなことしてるうちに\n桃子、お仕事干されちゃってさ……。", "zh": "这……这也是自作自受吧。做着那种事的时候，桃子就被停掉工作了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "9020044a3939f185d4a038362175445bbd8cd02d77376b7cce5948aca4e8cf0b", "ja": "そ、それで……。\nそのせいで、桃子のお父さんとお母さんは……。", "zh": "所、所以……\n都是因为那样，桃子的爸爸和妈妈才……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "b07c5f98b927291403d8f0d827d34cb7b257daa9988de759b73167b20a5643e8", "ja": "（もしも……もしもそれで\nふたりの桃子を見る目が変わったら……）", "zh": "（如果……如果因此，他们看桃子的眼神改变了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "7746b1d122bd03495d90aa58751661db35593ddb750fb4d9c08397e9672f01ed", "ja": "（もしもそれで……百合子さんとこのみさんまで\n桃子のそばから離れていったら……）", "zh": "（要是因此……连百合子姐姐和木实姐姐也离开桃子身边了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "2ca5a987e2a06078f50e5a01a79b0479f2908ce9add4594f5976e26a315d7b18", "ja": "あ……、\nえ……！？", "zh": "啊…… \n诶……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "c7de0ad7cc1a0779d543134d847e857f10c026012aebe4f7be8406e17d833b1e", "ja": "桃子ちゃんっ！？", "zh": "桃子——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "22f43236924bb6177ff571967e975d214e0cc4405d11464c56e92ec26c6cd3bc", "ja": "あ……あ……。", "zh": "啊……啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "0d12e9f3c0da6e5c6c32ab93748264f31b9cbcbd5c44e7ca98804e3e7038c9eb", "ja": "（今、私の顔を見て、\n桃子ちゃんの心が傷ついたのがはっきりとわかった）", "zh": "（现在，看着我的脸，我清楚地感觉到桃子受伤了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "3a4c5bc298982a4a818a358173039a43bfdb94481304a049fa8aa3acb6051a03", "ja": "（ちがう。そうじゃない、そうじゃないんだよ\n桃子ちゃん。嫌いになんてなってないよ）", "zh": "（不是的。不是那样，不是那样的\n桃子。我根本没有讨厌你。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "c8eb7430f6541c00ec7c62809c666f54ea942d5ad8c73492a1f62aeb9f04122a", "ja": "（私はなにも知らなかったから、びっくりしただけ。\n過去になにがあったとかそんなこと関係ない）", "zh": "（因为我什么都不知道，所以才吓了一跳。过去发生过什么之类的，和这没有关系。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "859dd156ce4e3a64654422e87b4194501a4237c51d0dd542629f0a4a060d1bef", "ja": "（そんなのどうだっていいんだよ。おねがい、離れて\nいかないで。私……私は……今の桃子ちゃんが……！）", "zh": "（那些都无所谓了。求求你，不要离开\n不要离开我。我……我……现在的桃子……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "c30f143ab401230ae3410165805c0c9d78cb42790ab2169d692a29740f7258eb", "ja": "（伝えなきゃいけない言葉はたくさんあるのに、\n身体が動かない。……わかってしまった）", "zh": "（明明有那么多必须传达的话，身体却动不了。……我明白了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "1a91e10168f50831a3ee4d02f6638d60c55558a871dfaf6789cebc0c5d790ff2", "ja": "（あの瞳の奥にはどんな言葉ももう届かない。\nそれほどの過ちを、私は今、冒してしまったんだ）", "zh": "（那双眼眸深处，已经听不进任何话语了。\n我现在犯下的错误，已经严重到了这种地步）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1026_039kon", "source_sha256": "e603c98ea362984612065a36928a8458d2ff8d0ee3108824aea282d0793d392a", "ja": "なにやってるの！　立ちなさい！！", "zh": "你在做什么！给我站起来！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "7bc6cc4f5f6942e3593073f821c0ee3e9d0415a7b7db86596d21cae47ea9096d", "ja": "追いかけるわよ！　こんなことで……\n私たちを終わらせてたまるもんですか！", "zh": "追上去！我们才不会因为这种事……就这样结束！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "e3eca28ac1602f94a750fac18c1f5bd396ce65dadf8e890096da2fa6c623cefd", "ja": "（……嫌われた。嫌われた……嫌われた……！\n百合子さんに嫌われた！）", "zh": "（……被讨厌了。被讨厌了……被讨厌了……！\n被百合子姐姐讨厌了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "dc311639d0b380245978bd3be265650aeb98e45065c2593d5b30e09b8f0a1971", "ja": "（信じてたのに……！）", "zh": "（明明相信了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "97c60b2a0944a2695e98105d14acb0b47b9712a3833a95cc5c07f81db11a9c43", "ja": "（百合子さんなら受け入れてくれるって信じてたのに！\nそれでもやっぱりダメだった！）", "zh": "（明明相信百合子小姐会接受桃子的！\n可结果还是不行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1031_049mom", "source_sha256": "659d0713ad7adb731193d5eb469ee7621be0bfe2cdc7c4355a19cefb1a9cbd71", "ja": "ハァ……ハァ……。\n…………？", "zh": "哈啊……哈啊……。\n…………？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1032_se", "source_sha256": "ece63676a9716e7482361fa8f260e928a21eca99a8849c91906cd24905b4b7f6", "ja": "キラッ", "zh": "闪亮登场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1033_049mom", "source_sha256": "b4676068011b553ba558da0464934b282db7157637dcc91e674bf7fab15856b9", "ja": "「ロコさんに教えてもらってね、作ってたんだ。\nこれ……おそろいのブレスレット」", "zh": "「是ROCO教我做的。\n这个……是一对的手链」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "1f638566fda6c4687b096fb5130226f9f37fb8d43a083247ae600d9f32940836", "ja": "「……クリスマスプレゼントだよ」", "zh": "……这是圣诞礼物哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "99e0ebf1ed5e3636a5d80bc4dbf90a7b6ab4f7fc4e10b1eb3d907bb90921bad4", "ja": "……っ！　こんなの……こんなの……！\nもういらないっ！", "zh": "……！这种东西……这种东西……！\n我已经不需要了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1036_049mom", "source_sha256": "38f2224d69960fde16034991d82d562cc474b21a04c1fcd06864c158cac76604", "ja": "……っ！　う、うぅ……！", "zh": "……！　呜、呜呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1037_049mom", "source_sha256": "32a8072e4bc3b1ad84cc397b6b75b1efb3a675907f1317ed28d4bbb7a7a24271", "ja": "（……ちがう。百合子さんはなにも悪くない。\nぜんぶぜんぶ、なにもかも……）", "zh": "（……不是的。百合子姐姐什么都没做错。\n全都是，全都是，一切的一切……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_05_1038_049mom", "source_sha256": "671f8aa65ac0aee7d48eaebd695375cfee5954ffebdcbb6f2279047289d901ef", "ja": "（桃子のせいだ……）", "zh": "（都是桃子的错……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
